title Instant Context Flow

participant "MCP Client" as Client
participant "Context Provider" as Provider
participant "Task Analyzer" as Task
participant "File Analyzer" as FileAnalyzer
participant "Hierarchical Analyzer" as Hierarchical
participant "Semantic Cache" as Cache
participant "Strategy Library" as Strategies
participant "Cache Manager" as CacheMgr
participant "Proactive Suggester" as Proactive

note over Client, Proactive: === Context Request ===

Client->Provider: get_instant_context(filePath, taskDescription)
activate Provider

Provider->Task: Analyze task description
activate Task
Task->Task: Extract task type (refactoring, debugging, feature add)
Task->Task: Identify relevant layers (Vision, Structure, Logic, Flow, Code)
Task->Task: Determine focus areas
Task-->Provider: Task analysis
deactivate Task

Provider->FileAnalyzer: Analyze file structure
activate FileAnalyzer
FileAnalyzer->FileAnalyzer: Parse AST
FileAnalyzer->FileAnalyzer: Extract symbols
FileAnalyzer->FileAnalyzer: Calculate complexity
FileAnalyzer->FileAnalyzer: Detect patterns
FileAnalyzer->FileAnalyzer: Identify code smells
FileAnalyzer-->Provider: File analysis
deactivate FileAnalyzer

note over Provider: === Context Collection ===

Provider->Cache: Query semantic cache
activate Cache
Cache->Cache: Load vision artifacts
Cache->Cache: Load structure artifacts
Cache->Cache: Load logic artifacts
Cache->Cache: Load flow artifacts
Cache->Cache: Load code artifacts
Cache-->Provider: Cached artifacts
deactivate Cache

Provider->Hierarchical: Perform hierarchical analysis
activate Hierarchical

Hierarchical->Hierarchical: Cluster-level metrics
Hierarchical->Hierarchical: Cross-module dependencies
Hierarchical->Hierarchical: Cohesion calculation
Hierarchical->Hierarchical: Coupling analysis
Hierarchical->Hierarchical: Aggregate cluster metrics
Hierarchical-->Provider: Hierarchical metrics
deactivate Hierarchical

note over Provider: === Task-Aware Optimization ===

Provider->Provider: Apply task type filtering
note right of Provider: Refactoring task:\n- Focus on structure & logic\n- Highlight coupling\n- Show code smells

Provider->Provider: Prioritize relevant layers
Provider->Provider: Filter by focus areas
Provider->Provider: Rank artifacts by relevance

Provider->Strategies: Get strategy suggestions
activate Strategies
Strategies->Strategies: Match task to strategies
Strategies->Strategies: Select optimal strategies
Strategies-->Provider: Strategy recommendations
deactivate Strategies

note over Provider: === Proactive Context Suggestions ===

Provider->Proactive: Get related files
activate Proactive
Proactive->Cache: Query cross-layer links
Cache-->Proactive: Link graph
Proactive->Proactive: Find related components
Proactive->Proactive: Identify dependent flows
Proactive->Proactive: Suggest related entities
Proactive-->Provider: Related files
deactivate Proactive

Provider->Provider: Compile context package
Provider->Provider: Format for MCP response
Provider-->Client: Instant context response
deactivate Provider

note over Client, Proactive: === Cache Management ===

Client->CacheMgr: Check cache freshness
activate CacheMgr
CacheMgr->CacheMgr: Calculate file hashes
CacheMgr->CacheMgr: Compare with cached hashes
CacheMgr->CacheMgr: Identify stale artifacts

alt Stale artifacts detected
    CacheMgr->Provider: Trigger rediscovery
    activate Provider
    Provider->Provider: Rediscover stale clusters
    Provider->Cache: Update cache
    Cache-->Provider: Success
    Provider-->CacheMgr: Rediscovery complete
    deactivate Provider
end

CacheMgr-->Client: Cache status
deactivate CacheMgr

note over Client, Proactive: === Context Usage Example ===

note right of Client: Task: "Refactor UserService"
note right of Provider: Returns:\n- UserService structure\n- Related entities\n- Flows using UserService\n- Code smells\n- Coupling metrics\n- Suggested refactoring strategies\n- Related files to review
